WEBVTT

00:16.230 --> 00:17.120
Manzhi.

00:18.350 --> 00:19.280
Honey.

00:19.530 --> 00:23.010
[Six months ago]

00:20.230 --> 00:22.100
I shouldn't have done that.

00:22.440 --> 00:24.280
Open the door and let's talk.

00:25.600 --> 00:26.600
Okay?

00:27.000 --> 00:27.760
Manzhi,

00:28.130 --> 00:30.180
why is it

00:30.210 --> 00:33.000
so hard for the two of us to even sit down

00:33.470 --> 00:34.790
and talk calmly now?

00:36.520 --> 00:38.600
When we first met,

00:38.600 --> 00:39.750
we were at a casino.

00:39.920 --> 00:41.650
You told me to follow your bets,

00:41.790 --> 00:42.910
and we

00:42.930 --> 00:45.770
won 17 rounds in a row.
Have you forgotten?

00:46.960 --> 00:48.030
Back then, you said

00:48.220 --> 00:51.420
I was the most daring man you'd ever seen.

00:51.450 --> 00:55.250
And I said you were my lucky goddess.

00:55.270 --> 00:56.300
Have you forgotten all that?

00:56.300 --> 00:57.880
Tang Yushan, Tang Yushan,

00:57.880 --> 00:58.840
I'm begging you.

00:58.840 --> 01:00.240
Please let me go.

01:00.240 --> 01:01.030
I'm begging you.

01:01.030 --> 01:02.840
Can you just let me go?

01:02.860 --> 01:03.920
You're begging me?

01:03.970 --> 01:05.160
You're my wife,

01:05.190 --> 01:06.470
and you're begging me?

01:06.510 --> 01:07.760
Haven't I been good to you?

01:07.760 --> 01:08.950
If others heard this,

01:08.950 --> 01:11.680
they'd think I was a despicable man!

01:12.200 --> 01:13.560
Manzhi,

01:13.760 --> 01:14.789
open the door! Open the door!

01:14.789 --> 01:17.250
I'm so good to you,
and you want to divorce me?

01:17.250 --> 01:19.240
Tang Yushan, you don't love me at all!

01:19.240 --> 01:20.570
Open it!

01:20.640 --> 01:21.440
Open the door!

01:21.680 --> 01:22.789
Open the door!

01:24.310 --> 01:25.120
Open the door!

01:26.840 --> 01:27.640
Open the door!

01:29.590 --> 01:31.120
What's with all the ruckus?

01:31.560 --> 01:32.890
Open the door right now!

01:42.720 --> 01:43.570
Director Fan.

01:52.229 --> 01:53.000
Director Fan,

01:53.000 --> 01:53.930
what a rare honor

01:54.150 --> 01:55.350
to have you here today.

01:55.350 --> 01:56.070
Mr. Tang,

01:56.229 --> 01:58.870
my men received a complaint

01:58.900 --> 02:00.760
about a lot of noise
coming from your house.

02:00.760 --> 02:03.070
When I heard it was about you,

02:03.240 --> 02:05.000
I decided to come over personally.

02:05.000 --> 02:06.560
Are you moving,

02:06.560 --> 02:07.950
or throwing a party?

02:10.030 --> 02:10.560
Fan,

02:11.150 --> 02:12.400
we go way back,

02:12.560 --> 02:14.030
so I won't hide it from you.

02:14.490 --> 02:16.840
Every family has its own troubles.

02:17.630 --> 02:18.280
My wife

02:18.800 --> 02:19.840
is an actress. You know that.

02:19.840 --> 02:21.360
Lately, those reporters are always

02:21.360 --> 02:23.400
looking for something to write about.

02:23.400 --> 02:25.000
She's under a lot of stress
and has been losing her temper.

02:25.000 --> 02:25.910
See?

02:26.030 --> 02:27.190
There's nothing I can do about it.

02:27.190 --> 02:28.320
Please bear with us.

02:30.730 --> 02:34.320
Your wife has quite a bit of strength.

02:35.720 --> 02:36.750
Give me a second.

02:41.710 --> 02:42.510
Director Fan,

02:42.710 --> 02:43.680
I'm really sorry

02:43.680 --> 02:45.190
for disturbing the neighbors

02:45.190 --> 02:46.750
and making you and your men
come all the way here

02:46.750 --> 02:48.470
so late at night.

02:48.490 --> 02:50.840
Let's play cards together sometime.

02:52.620 --> 02:53.660
Sure thing.

02:59.090 --> 02:59.970
Director Fan.

03:02.950 --> 03:05.230
Could I trouble your men to help me

03:05.250 --> 03:06.850
with one more small matter?

05:35.060 --> 05:38.840
[A Prophet]

05:39.790 --> 05:41.900
[Episode 17]

05:43.630 --> 05:44.560
Second Brother,

05:45.070 --> 05:46.870
Shangguan Chengming didn't care

05:46.870 --> 05:49.110
about your beloved treasure at all.

05:49.840 --> 05:51.630
He smashed it without a second thought.

05:51.630 --> 05:53.070
And the woman you love

05:53.510 --> 05:55.360
has eyes only for him.

05:56.480 --> 05:58.010
I really feel sorry for you.

05:59.000 --> 06:00.650
You came all the way here

06:00.900 --> 06:02.300
in the middle of the night

06:03.060 --> 06:05.700
just to rub salt in my wounds?

06:07.000 --> 06:08.130
A couple of days ago,

06:08.990 --> 06:10.590
I ran into a drunkard.

06:10.990 --> 06:13.720
He shouted at Shangguan Chengming...

06:13.740 --> 06:14.860
Wang Jiaxian!

06:15.680 --> 06:16.870
Why are you here?

06:17.390 --> 06:20.360
If we can prove

06:20.360 --> 06:22.360
that he isn't Shangguan Chengming,

06:22.430 --> 06:23.870
wouldn't that settle

06:24.070 --> 06:25.730
both the Sect Master's matter

06:25.750 --> 06:27.190
and yours?

06:31.310 --> 06:32.070
That's him!

06:37.380 --> 06:38.290
What are you doing?

06:38.290 --> 06:40.020
You're Yang Xiaozhong, right?

06:40.450 --> 06:41.200
Yes.

06:41.230 --> 06:42.330
We've received a report

06:42.330 --> 06:44.200
that you're involved in a fraud case.

06:44.200 --> 06:45.280
Come with us.

06:45.480 --> 06:47.070
Officers, you must have the wrong person.

06:47.070 --> 06:47.720
No.

06:47.720 --> 06:48.240
Move!

06:48.240 --> 06:49.390
Are you just going to arrest me

06:49.390 --> 06:51.159
in broad daylight like this?

06:51.159 --> 06:52.560
Is there no law anymore?

06:52.560 --> 06:53.430
Cut the crap!

06:53.430 --> 06:54.040
Move!

06:58.950 --> 06:59.560
Hello.

06:59.870 --> 07:00.360
Hello.

07:00.360 --> 07:02.250
I'm looking for Mr. Yang Xiaozhong.

07:02.250 --> 07:03.970
Could you tell me which room he's in?

07:03.970 --> 07:06.410
He must've committed a serious crime.

07:06.440 --> 07:09.440
The police just took him away
with a hood over his head.

07:12.480 --> 07:13.160
Thank you.

07:16.670 --> 07:18.040
It definitely wasn't the police.

07:18.040 --> 07:19.040
Of course.

07:19.180 --> 07:21.850
How would the police
put a hood over a suspect's head?

07:21.850 --> 07:22.760
They did it

07:23.340 --> 07:25.800
so he wouldn't know
where he was being taken.

07:27.920 --> 07:30.240
Who else do you think

07:30.260 --> 07:32.990
would be interested in
Yang Xiaozhong right now?

07:50.250 --> 07:51.580
Do you know this person?

07:54.750 --> 07:55.950
According to our investigation,

07:55.950 --> 07:58.240
this man is part of a fraud ring.

07:58.240 --> 08:00.920
He scammed a high-ranking official
out of over 100 gold bars.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.310
Are you his accomplice?

08:02.480 --> 08:03.600
No.

08:04.270 --> 08:05.310
Bullshit.

08:05.950 --> 08:06.870
Someone saw

08:06.870 --> 08:08.200
you with him last night.

08:08.440 --> 08:09.330
Here's the deal.

08:09.330 --> 08:10.590
I'll give you a choice.

08:10.610 --> 08:13.490
Do you want to be a suspect

08:14.040 --> 08:16.360
or a witness?

08:16.750 --> 08:17.430
Tell me.

08:18.000 --> 08:19.240
What's his name?

08:21.040 --> 08:21.920
Remember,

08:21.990 --> 08:23.330
I'm Shangguan Chengming.

08:23.330 --> 08:25.370
And we didn't know each other before,

08:25.370 --> 08:26.280
got it?

08:29.360 --> 08:31.220
His name is Shangguan Chengming.

08:31.430 --> 08:32.690
Shangguan Chengming?

08:34.150 --> 08:35.320
Shangguan...

08:35.799 --> 08:38.000
that's a pretty rare surname, isn't it?

08:38.240 --> 08:39.360
Is it his real name?

08:39.710 --> 08:41.159
Yes,

08:41.390 --> 08:42.450
it's his real name.

08:43.200 --> 08:45.750
Looks like you still
don't want to tell the truth.

08:45.750 --> 08:46.840
Listen up,

08:46.860 --> 08:49.300
this guy's underlings
have already confessed.

08:49.300 --> 08:50.490
It's on you now.

08:50.520 --> 08:51.710
Think about it.

08:52.030 --> 08:53.200
Ten years in prison.

08:53.240 --> 08:54.460
Delicate and soft as you are,

08:54.460 --> 08:56.740
could you really survive in there?

09:08.910 --> 09:10.550
I really don't know him.

09:10.840 --> 09:13.720
I only know
his name is Shangguan Chengming.

09:14.670 --> 09:15.750
Really.

09:17.120 --> 09:18.670
How did you guys meet?

09:18.720 --> 09:19.850
F-Fortune telling.

09:20.720 --> 09:21.720
Fortune telling.

09:21.740 --> 09:23.870
In our line of work, we believe in that.

09:24.390 --> 09:25.870
Whether a film will be a hit

09:26.200 --> 09:27.790
doesn't depend on the script

09:27.790 --> 09:30.630
but on what the fortune tellers say.

09:33.610 --> 09:34.600
Why do I feel like

09:34.630 --> 09:37.160
this director is
actually telling the truth?

09:37.900 --> 09:39.020
Don't tell me...

09:40.460 --> 09:42.060
you've dragged me into this.

09:43.790 --> 09:45.030
What's in it for me?

09:48.030 --> 09:48.960
Second Brother,

09:49.100 --> 09:50.340
time to get rough.

09:58.050 --> 09:58.930
Tell us!

09:59.480 --> 10:01.120
Still not telling the truth, huh?

10:01.120 --> 10:03.120
I don't know...

10:09.180 --> 10:10.250
Speak!

10:17.530 --> 10:18.860
Enough, enough.

10:18.890 --> 10:20.530
Don't actually kill him.

10:24.750 --> 10:25.510
Boss,

10:25.790 --> 10:26.630
how about

10:27.200 --> 10:28.860
we feed him some steamed buns?

10:31.000 --> 10:32.660
Steamed buns with cold water.

10:32.800 --> 10:33.400
Good idea.

10:33.430 --> 10:34.280
On it!

10:40.130 --> 10:40.970
A steamed bun.

10:41.390 --> 10:42.250
Isn't it great?

10:42.910 --> 10:43.870
Eat up.

10:44.670 --> 10:46.200
Must I feed you myself?

10:46.200 --> 10:52.120
Eat! Eat!

10:54.280 --> 10:55.160
Director Yang,

10:55.180 --> 10:57.000
your industry is associated with

10:57.000 --> 10:58.630
the Fire element.

10:59.440 --> 11:00.760
That's exactly

11:00.890 --> 11:04.010
where so many films flop—
chasing the heat too hard.

11:04.120 --> 11:05.030
Yes.

11:05.600 --> 11:07.510
Sir, you're quite an expert.

11:08.080 --> 11:09.240
Hardly.

11:09.440 --> 11:10.550
I just know a thing or two.

11:10.550 --> 11:11.200
But...

11:12.000 --> 11:13.730
we're just discussing, right?

11:14.550 --> 11:15.550
I think

11:15.550 --> 11:16.750
a good director

11:16.960 --> 11:19.530
should at least know
when to push and when to ease off.

11:19.530 --> 11:21.590
Stacking hit after hit is dangerous.

11:22.360 --> 11:23.790
You need at least one

11:23.840 --> 11:24.790
you go all-in on,

11:25.030 --> 11:26.200
and one you ease off on,

11:26.200 --> 11:27.240
right?

11:30.250 --> 11:32.650
Having enough
is better than having it all.

11:34.000 --> 11:34.790
Spot on.

11:45.580 --> 11:46.390
Here we are.

11:49.320 --> 11:50.080
Sir,

11:50.400 --> 11:52.590
I... can leave now?

11:52.930 --> 11:54.010
Can I?

11:54.270 --> 11:55.320
Sure.

11:55.840 --> 11:56.440
Come on.

12:03.210 --> 12:04.940
Director Yang? Director Yang.

12:05.960 --> 12:06.630
This way.

12:06.960 --> 12:07.510
Let me see you out.

12:07.510 --> 12:07.910
Let's go.

12:07.910 --> 12:08.440
Sir.

12:08.910 --> 12:09.510
No need.

12:10.360 --> 12:10.720
I...

12:11.120 --> 12:12.150
Don't mention it.

12:12.630 --> 12:13.150
Sir.

12:14.120 --> 12:15.030
I've told you

12:15.750 --> 12:16.960
everything I know.

12:17.360 --> 12:17.910
Yes.

12:17.960 --> 12:19.550
I know.

12:19.550 --> 12:20.150
Listen,

12:20.150 --> 12:20.840
calm down.

12:20.840 --> 12:21.510
I know!

12:23.270 --> 12:24.130
Director Yang.

12:24.270 --> 12:24.800
Sir.

12:25.140 --> 12:27.000
Let's get things straight first.

12:27.320 --> 12:28.720
Every debt has its debtor.

12:28.720 --> 12:29.550
When you get down there,

12:29.550 --> 12:31.000
you should know exactly

12:31.440 --> 12:32.960
who to go after.

12:37.200 --> 12:37.600
Sir...

12:37.600 --> 12:38.460
Director Yang,

12:38.630 --> 12:39.910
may you rest in peace.

12:48.120 --> 12:48.880
Sir...

12:49.910 --> 12:50.670
Sir!

12:51.440 --> 12:52.200
Sir!

12:53.120 --> 12:54.200
I'll confess!

12:54.480 --> 12:56.410
-I'll tell you everything!
-Stop.

13:06.390 --> 13:07.200
It must've been Master Swindler

13:07.200 --> 13:08.800
who put Second Batou up to it.

13:09.910 --> 13:10.790
How do you know?

13:11.630 --> 13:12.780
Master Swindler

13:12.800 --> 13:14.810
has always been
the Sect Master's designated successor,

13:14.810 --> 13:16.710
in charge of
maintaining order within the sect.

13:16.710 --> 13:18.640
But he's the most unruly one.

13:18.760 --> 13:21.360
He sure fooled the Sect Master.

13:21.800 --> 13:24.120
You really think
the Sect Master can't see through him?

13:24.120 --> 13:25.600
He's just old,

13:25.750 --> 13:27.120
not senile.

13:27.440 --> 13:29.500
He simply chooses not to call him out.

13:30.270 --> 13:31.080
True.

13:31.720 --> 13:34.250
Who could hide anything
from the Sect Master?

13:35.720 --> 13:36.750
Not necessarily.

13:37.440 --> 13:39.900
Some people have managed to
fool him, right?

13:40.030 --> 13:41.360
A person can be deceived

13:41.870 --> 13:43.320
because deep down,

13:44.320 --> 13:45.720
they want to be deceived.

13:47.240 --> 13:48.900
Who are you two talking about?

13:49.910 --> 13:50.670
You.

13:55.360 --> 13:56.240
They've left.

13:59.440 --> 14:00.480
Not me, right?

14:00.630 --> 14:01.270
Quiet.

14:07.310 --> 14:08.310
Get down here.

14:10.860 --> 14:11.780
They bought it?

14:14.320 --> 14:14.910
Anyway,

14:15.440 --> 14:17.240
I said what was written on that bun.

14:17.240 --> 14:18.510
Must I feed you myself?

14:19.390 --> 14:20.510
Look carefully!

14:20.530 --> 14:21.410
This is a bun!

14:21.730 --> 14:24.060
[Insist that Tang Yushan
knows Shangguan Chengming.]

14:27.420 --> 14:28.900
Eat! Eat!

14:48.050 --> 14:48.840
How was it?

14:49.770 --> 14:51.570
More thrilling than making movies, right?

14:51.570 --> 14:53.450
Making movies only costs money.

14:54.910 --> 14:56.570
Your line of work costs lives.

14:58.320 --> 14:58.960
Let's go.

15:02.360 --> 15:04.650
Ever since I entered this business,
I've been

15:04.650 --> 15:07.080
working hard in pursuit of
my beautiful artistic ideals.

15:07.080 --> 15:09.740
But you people trample on my soul
with your money

15:10.240 --> 15:12.320
and use your power to force me to submit.

15:12.320 --> 15:13.320
I'm telling you,

15:14.080 --> 15:15.320
I will never agree.

15:17.320 --> 15:19.520
This is the unfinished half of the movie

15:19.550 --> 15:20.880
that Tang talked about.

15:21.120 --> 15:22.120
It's my fault too.

15:22.870 --> 15:25.200
After the publicity and buzz
we got from that cemetery stunt,

15:25.200 --> 15:26.960
he now wants me to finish this movie.

15:26.960 --> 15:28.670
Does he still have money to make a movie?

15:28.670 --> 15:30.390
Actually, he's never had much money.

15:30.390 --> 15:31.600
But this guy really is an expert

15:31.600 --> 15:33.440
at getting something for nothing.

15:33.440 --> 15:34.750
He fools investors

15:35.150 --> 15:36.870
while borrowing from loan sharks.

15:36.870 --> 15:39.120
Then why don't we come at it
from this angle

15:39.120 --> 15:40.510
and make him unable to repay his debts?

15:40.510 --> 15:41.550
How do you usually

15:42.270 --> 15:43.790
choose actresses for your movies?

15:43.790 --> 15:45.630
That's quite complicated.

15:46.080 --> 15:47.120
Say...

15:47.510 --> 15:48.480
I'm the director.

15:48.480 --> 15:50.720
Then I certainly have the power
to recommend someone.

15:50.720 --> 15:51.630
The investors
have considerable sway as well.

15:51.630 --> 15:52.910
Sometimes they insist

15:52.910 --> 15:54.770
that you use a particular person.

15:58.240 --> 15:59.240
Don't forget,

15:59.240 --> 16:01.390
the employment contract
you signed with the company

16:01.390 --> 16:02.520
states clearly that

16:02.600 --> 16:04.690
if the company suffers losses

16:04.720 --> 16:07.000
for personal reasons...

16:07.490 --> 16:08.570
Listen up,

16:08.600 --> 16:10.330
I'm giving you two choices now.

16:10.520 --> 16:12.550
Either sign this agreement

16:12.580 --> 16:14.740
or pay compensation and leave!

16:18.910 --> 16:20.390
I will make this movie...

16:21.920 --> 16:22.880
a huge hit.

16:25.020 --> 16:27.260
Tang Yushan is a compulsive gambler.

16:28.090 --> 16:30.150
Only gambling can get his attention.

16:30.410 --> 16:33.010
What does a gambler need the most?

16:33.200 --> 16:34.270
Money.

16:35.990 --> 16:38.120
He was desperately pursuing He Manzhi

16:38.480 --> 16:40.510
because she was rich.

16:41.200 --> 16:42.360
Living off a woman

16:42.910 --> 16:44.750
is his greatest ambition.

16:51.870 --> 16:53.080
Let's go, cousin.

16:53.200 --> 16:54.320
Let's go dance.

16:57.550 --> 16:58.320
Oh my God.

16:58.320 --> 16:59.080
I'm sorry.

16:59.150 --> 16:59.960
Are you blind?

16:59.960 --> 17:00.600
I'm really sorry.

17:00.600 --> 17:02.390
Do you know how expensive this dress is?

17:02.390 --> 17:03.920
Can you afford to pay for it?

17:04.680 --> 17:05.270
Forget it.

17:05.270 --> 17:05.589
Let's go.

17:05.589 --> 17:06.119
Let's go.

17:07.109 --> 17:08.240
Chief Editor Zheng!

17:09.030 --> 17:10.000
Mr. Tang?

17:10.000 --> 17:11.069
It really is you.

17:12.920 --> 17:14.400
Some friend you are.

17:14.790 --> 17:16.900
Going out for drinks
and not even asking me along?

17:16.900 --> 17:17.940
And who is this?

17:17.970 --> 17:19.700
Mr. Tang, let me introduce you.

17:19.720 --> 17:22.130
This is my cousin, Jiang Manyu.

17:22.510 --> 17:23.680
Nice to meet you, Miss Manyu.

17:23.680 --> 17:24.829
I'm Tang Yushan.

17:25.200 --> 17:26.109
Cousin,

17:26.240 --> 17:27.310
I came all the way back from overseas

17:27.310 --> 17:28.349
just to avoid all the social engagements

17:28.349 --> 17:29.950
my dad keeps setting up for me.

17:29.950 --> 17:31.590
And now here I am,
dealing with the same old song and dance.

17:31.590 --> 17:33.250
You brought me out for drinks,

17:33.440 --> 17:35.350
and I have to deal with this nobody?

17:35.350 --> 17:36.270
Miss Manyu,

17:36.270 --> 17:38.000
you don't like drinking?

17:38.920 --> 17:40.000
It's alright.

17:40.000 --> 17:41.440
I drink a little sometimes.

17:41.440 --> 17:42.790
Any other hobbies?

17:44.070 --> 17:45.440
I like...

17:46.160 --> 17:47.760
looking at beautiful women.

17:49.070 --> 17:51.800
Miss Manyu, you certainly have
an unusual hobby.

17:52.030 --> 17:53.680
Well, cousin,

17:53.960 --> 17:56.070
when that beauty walks down the stairs,

17:56.070 --> 17:57.590
how many men
do you think will turn to look?

17:57.590 --> 17:58.880
I'd say...

17:59.640 --> 18:00.440
3.

18:00.750 --> 18:01.750
Three?

18:02.080 --> 18:03.950
Men really don't understand men.

18:03.980 --> 18:05.080
Then what's your guess?

18:05.080 --> 18:06.170
If you ask me,

18:06.610 --> 18:07.770
at least 6.

18:08.350 --> 18:10.160
How about we make a bet?

18:10.160 --> 18:10.960
Sure.

18:11.240 --> 18:12.000
Mr. Tang?

18:12.200 --> 18:14.240
Then I'll join the fun too.

18:14.400 --> 18:17.350
That "at least" of yours
was very well put.

18:17.350 --> 18:19.310
I bet at least 8.

18:22.480 --> 18:23.310
One,

18:23.440 --> 18:24.350
two,

18:24.480 --> 18:26.170
three, four, five...

18:28.310 --> 18:29.070
Six.

18:31.640 --> 18:32.550
Seven.

18:33.150 --> 18:34.390
Eight.

18:34.480 --> 18:35.570
Nine.

18:36.310 --> 18:37.550
Ten.

18:38.310 --> 18:39.590
Eleven.

18:41.030 --> 18:41.960
You win.

18:42.110 --> 18:42.880
Here you go.

18:43.960 --> 18:45.490
It's not much money anyway.

18:46.510 --> 18:47.350
Waiter!

18:48.050 --> 18:48.960
Yes, sir.

18:49.370 --> 18:51.480
I'm in a particularly good mood today.

18:51.480 --> 18:53.200
So I'm buying a drink for

18:53.220 --> 18:55.330
every guest here tonight.

18:55.590 --> 18:56.440
Certainly, sir.

18:56.440 --> 18:57.720
Great!

19:01.750 --> 19:02.830
Oh, this is bad.

19:03.350 --> 19:04.880
I'm out of money for drinks.

19:05.440 --> 19:06.440
Miss Manyu,

19:07.160 --> 19:08.590
could you buy me a drink?

19:08.590 --> 19:09.880
It would be my honor.

19:13.750 --> 19:14.510
Cousin,

19:14.720 --> 19:17.640
this friend of yours is quite interesting.

19:19.350 --> 19:20.030
Please.

19:21.720 --> 19:22.790
Miss Manyu,

19:23.030 --> 19:24.270
how long do you plan to stay this time?

19:24.270 --> 19:25.000
I don't know.

19:25.000 --> 19:26.840
My cousin is busy from morning till night,

19:26.840 --> 19:28.390
and my parents don't even know I'm back.

19:28.390 --> 19:29.810
There's no one to hang out with.

19:29.810 --> 19:30.770
So boring.

19:30.880 --> 19:31.920
Your father

19:32.110 --> 19:34.070
must be quite strict with you.

19:34.400 --> 19:35.440
He just wants what's best for you.

19:35.440 --> 19:36.680
Don't mention him.

19:36.680 --> 19:39.030
He's always surrounded by a crowd,

19:39.030 --> 19:40.350
and he lectures me all the time.

19:40.350 --> 19:42.680
He really thinks
everyone is his subordinate.

19:42.680 --> 19:43.640
Well, men

19:43.640 --> 19:44.720
sometimes

19:44.880 --> 19:46.740
can't balance career and family.

19:46.790 --> 19:48.050
It's understandable.

19:48.240 --> 19:50.350
May I ask what your father does?

19:52.640 --> 19:54.640
He's just a lousy bank president.

19:54.880 --> 19:56.340
What's so great about him?

19:57.030 --> 19:58.030
Miss Manyu,

19:59.240 --> 20:01.440
I have a presumptuous request.

20:02.480 --> 20:03.480
What is it?

20:04.920 --> 20:06.850
Let me formally introduce myself.

20:08.010 --> 20:08.890
I'm Tang Yushan,

20:08.890 --> 20:11.150
General Manager of Changfeng Pictures.

20:13.070 --> 20:14.070
Movie...

20:14.230 --> 20:16.840
My company is currently casting

20:16.990 --> 20:18.390
a female lead for a movie.

20:18.510 --> 20:20.310
In my mind,

20:20.310 --> 20:21.880
she should be

20:21.880 --> 20:23.920
beautiful, elegant,

20:24.790 --> 20:27.270
well-mannered, and gentle.

20:27.290 --> 20:29.600
And above all, she should have

20:29.720 --> 20:33.350
that independent, free spirit
and the strength that comes with it.

20:33.350 --> 20:35.480
To be honest, it's really hard to find.

20:35.480 --> 20:37.080
I was almost ready to give up.

20:37.350 --> 20:38.920
Until I saw you just now.

20:38.960 --> 20:40.160
You know, in that instant,

20:40.160 --> 20:42.160
I...

20:42.160 --> 20:43.960
Acting in a movie, right?

20:45.270 --> 20:47.750
That sounds quite interesting.

20:48.030 --> 20:49.440
I'm kind of interested.

20:49.550 --> 20:51.310
But Mr. Tang,

20:51.510 --> 20:53.510
who would I be acting with?

20:53.960 --> 20:54.920
He Manzhi.

20:55.400 --> 20:56.440
He Man...

20:56.880 --> 20:57.830
He Manzhi?

20:58.160 --> 20:58.960
Oh my God.

20:59.440 --> 21:01.440
Didn't He Manzhi

21:01.680 --> 21:02.880
die recently?

21:03.000 --> 21:03.720
Yes.

21:04.830 --> 21:05.590
Suicide.

21:06.310 --> 21:07.970
I don't want to hide anything.

21:08.200 --> 21:09.270
She was my wife.

21:10.160 --> 21:11.030
And this movie

21:11.030 --> 21:13.030
was also her last, unfinished work.

21:13.860 --> 21:15.420
I must find someone,

21:15.680 --> 21:18.160
someone who can truly take her place,

21:18.240 --> 21:19.790
to fulfill her wish.

21:20.640 --> 21:21.750
Can you do it?

21:22.510 --> 21:23.680
He Manzhi...

21:25.310 --> 21:26.200
But...

21:26.960 --> 21:27.960
can I really do it?

21:33.440 --> 21:34.240
Manyu.

21:38.750 --> 21:39.790
Look at her.

21:40.290 --> 21:41.620
She's so radiant.

21:43.480 --> 21:45.550
Manyu, have you ever thought about this?

21:45.550 --> 21:46.880
Imagine one day

21:46.900 --> 21:48.940
your arrogant father

21:48.960 --> 21:50.150
is walking down the street

21:50.150 --> 21:52.500
and passes a giant movie poster.

21:52.750 --> 21:56.030
And when he looks up at it,

21:56.830 --> 21:58.830
he finds that the person on it is you.

21:58.830 --> 22:00.400
How would that feel?

22:01.590 --> 22:02.790
Have you imagined it?

22:03.480 --> 22:05.200
If you star in this movie,

22:05.200 --> 22:06.160
you're not just

22:06.160 --> 22:08.270
taking over He Manzhi's role

22:09.270 --> 22:11.200
but also her status as a superstar.

22:13.110 --> 22:14.570
A chance to turn the tables

22:15.310 --> 22:16.790
doesn't come to everyone.

22:45.680 --> 22:46.310
Okay.

22:48.240 --> 22:49.830
There are a lot of people
auditioning today.

22:49.830 --> 22:51.030
So everyone,
let's make the most of our time.

22:51.030 --> 22:52.030
Okay.

22:52.030 --> 22:52.880
Alright.

22:55.480 --> 22:56.070
Action.

22:57.750 --> 23:00.510
Look how beautiful I am in the mirror.

23:00.510 --> 23:03.070
But I know that isn't the real me.

23:04.030 --> 23:06.880
But I know this isn't the real me.

23:06.900 --> 23:08.970
It's only the me they want to see.

23:09.180 --> 23:12.630
The saddest thing in the world is

23:12.650 --> 23:14.400
not even being able to tell for yourself

23:14.400 --> 23:17.710
if you're acting or living.

23:18.550 --> 23:19.080
Maybe...

23:19.110 --> 23:20.110
Have you been here before?

23:20.110 --> 23:21.790
I've long since become

23:22.070 --> 23:24.310
the most successful role I've ever played!

23:24.310 --> 23:24.960
Hello, Mr. Tang.

23:24.960 --> 23:25.960
Good work, everyone.

23:25.960 --> 23:27.750
Hello, Mr. Tang.

23:29.200 --> 23:30.400
Good work, everyone.

23:31.030 --> 23:31.550
How's it going?

23:31.550 --> 23:32.830
Is the audition going well today?

23:32.830 --> 23:34.760
Not bad. We're still working on it.

23:35.010 --> 23:35.780
Mr. Tang,

23:35.880 --> 23:37.200
who is this?

23:37.220 --> 23:39.230
Let me make a proper introduction.

23:39.260 --> 23:40.310
This is Miss Manyu,

23:40.310 --> 23:41.260
my friend.

23:41.350 --> 23:42.160
I brought her here today

23:42.160 --> 23:43.930
mainly so she could get a feel...

23:43.930 --> 23:46.010
a feel for the atmosphere here.

23:46.040 --> 23:47.090
This is my team.

23:47.110 --> 23:47.980
Man...

23:48.030 --> 23:49.270
Manyu, right?

23:49.270 --> 23:50.550
Hello, I'm the director of this movie.

23:50.550 --> 23:51.610
My name is Yang Xiaozhong.

23:51.610 --> 23:52.690
Manyu.

23:52.960 --> 23:55.560
Actually, I'd still like you
to do an audition.

23:57.240 --> 23:58.310
I have to audition?

23:58.310 --> 23:59.350
Of course.

23:59.400 --> 24:01.710
You'll do this one scene in a bit.

24:01.810 --> 24:02.810
Don't be nervous.

24:02.840 --> 24:04.840
Just go with your own feelings

24:04.920 --> 24:06.920
and say these lines, okay?

24:07.200 --> 24:07.960
I can't.

24:08.790 --> 24:09.590
Um...

24:10.510 --> 24:11.370
You, step down.

24:11.750 --> 24:12.200
Step down.

24:12.200 --> 24:12.920
Right now?

24:12.920 --> 24:14.110
Of course, now. Come on.

24:14.110 --> 24:15.030
Please don't make me do this.

24:15.030 --> 24:15.830
I say you can, so you can.

24:15.830 --> 24:16.550
Come on.

24:17.270 --> 24:18.270
I'm not doing it. It's too much trouble.

24:18.270 --> 24:19.160
Go away.

24:20.110 --> 24:21.200
Mr. Tang.

24:21.590 --> 24:23.110
So many people are watching.

24:23.110 --> 24:24.070
I feel quite embarrassed.

24:24.070 --> 24:25.550
What's there to be embarrassed about?

24:25.550 --> 24:26.510
Trust me.

24:31.110 --> 24:31.970
Take your time.

24:32.200 --> 24:33.260
Prepare yourself.

24:34.310 --> 24:36.880
Look how beautiful I am

24:37.270 --> 24:38.350
in the mirror.

24:38.370 --> 24:39.420
Look how beautiful I am...

24:39.420 --> 24:40.310
Manyu.

24:41.590 --> 24:42.440
You need to

24:43.070 --> 24:45.160
let these lines sink into your heart.

24:45.160 --> 24:47.310
Treat the stage as your home

24:47.640 --> 24:48.590
and enjoy it.

24:48.720 --> 24:49.450
Understand?

24:49.920 --> 24:50.640
Got it.

24:51.200 --> 24:54.440
Look how beautiful I am in the mirror.

24:55.830 --> 24:57.400
Look how beautiful I am in the mirror.

24:57.400 --> 24:59.070
Does she look the part?

24:59.590 --> 25:01.270
Yes, very much so.

25:01.440 --> 25:03.040
Director, what do you think?

25:03.160 --> 25:04.240
I think...

25:05.200 --> 25:06.550
her age...

25:06.720 --> 25:07.720
She's younger.

25:08.400 --> 25:10.330
She looks like a younger He Manzhi.

25:10.350 --> 25:11.410
Don't you think so?

25:12.030 --> 25:15.000
Mr. Tang, her potential
is absolutely incredible.

25:15.200 --> 25:18.400
Of course. You think she's
some country bumpkin like you?

25:18.550 --> 25:20.440
Her father is a banker.

25:20.550 --> 25:21.400
She just returned from studying abroad

25:21.400 --> 25:22.350
in America.

25:22.440 --> 25:23.240
Got it?

25:23.400 --> 25:24.070
Uh...

25:24.640 --> 25:25.920
Have you acted before?

25:26.030 --> 25:27.550
No, Director.

25:27.550 --> 25:29.720
Having no acting experience is the best.

25:29.720 --> 25:31.920
What we need is a blank slate.

25:31.920 --> 25:33.000
Why all the questions?

25:33.000 --> 25:33.480
If she already had acting experience,

25:33.480 --> 25:34.750
why would I need you as a director?

25:34.750 --> 25:37.140
Shoot 10 takes,
and one of them will be usable.

25:37.140 --> 25:38.340
You guys, step aside.

25:39.110 --> 25:39.790
Step aside.

25:40.400 --> 25:43.550
Look how beautiful I am in this mirror.

25:43.920 --> 25:45.200
Look how beautiful...

25:49.960 --> 25:50.920
-Okay?
-Okay.

25:51.070 --> 25:51.440
Alright. Come on.

25:51.440 --> 25:53.100
Attention, all departments.

25:53.440 --> 25:54.110
Lighting.

25:57.510 --> 25:59.000
Scene 3, Shot 3, Take 2.

26:00.160 --> 26:00.790
Rolling.

26:09.440 --> 26:10.160
Ah.

26:11.240 --> 26:14.400
Look how beautiful I am in that mirror.

26:14.620 --> 26:15.250
But...

26:15.640 --> 26:16.190
B-But...

26:17.350 --> 26:18.160
But I...

26:18.160 --> 26:19.550
But I know

26:19.880 --> 26:21.480
that's not the real me.

26:21.920 --> 26:22.960
That's just...

26:23.310 --> 26:24.030
That...

26:24.350 --> 26:25.400
What was it again?

26:25.440 --> 26:26.680
Sorry, Director.

26:26.750 --> 26:27.310
Okay, cut.

26:27.310 --> 26:28.550
That's just...

26:29.430 --> 26:30.510
You need to relax.

26:30.530 --> 26:31.480
Don't be nervous.

26:31.480 --> 26:32.830
Don't let all those words in the script

26:32.830 --> 26:34.400
hold you back.

26:34.400 --> 26:34.920
When the light hits you...

26:34.920 --> 26:36.640
I think you were really good.

26:36.770 --> 26:38.530
Very, very good.

26:38.680 --> 26:39.850
What do you guys think?

26:39.850 --> 26:41.250
Didn't she act adorably?

26:41.920 --> 26:43.270
So adorable!

26:44.240 --> 26:44.750
It's like this...

26:44.750 --> 26:45.200
I can't do this.

26:45.200 --> 26:46.350
I really don't know how to act.

26:46.350 --> 26:47.640
How hard can it be?

26:47.640 --> 26:49.310
Look at Mr. Big Shot.

26:49.680 --> 26:52.200
What did He Manzhi ever see in him?

26:52.350 --> 26:53.310
That's

26:53.750 --> 26:55.680
what you call the power of capital.

26:56.110 --> 26:57.200
Got it, got it.

26:58.640 --> 26:59.590
That's right!

26:59.590 --> 27:00.590
That's it!

27:00.590 --> 27:01.750
This is exactly the state I want you in.

27:01.750 --> 27:02.790
You're smiling.

27:03.310 --> 27:04.020
Don't move.

27:12.210 --> 27:14.140
Costume, makeup, and props teams.

27:15.880 --> 27:17.400
Costume, makeup, and props teams!

27:17.400 --> 27:18.590
Coming, coming!

27:20.550 --> 27:22.920
I'm paying you all

27:22.920 --> 27:24.960
because you're professionals.

27:25.110 --> 27:27.160
If you don't put the auditioning actress

27:27.160 --> 27:28.760
in the character's costume,

27:28.830 --> 27:30.310
give her the character's hairstyle,

27:30.310 --> 27:31.240
and put the character's jewelry on her,

27:31.240 --> 27:32.920
how do you expect her

27:32.920 --> 27:33.880
to get into the role?

27:33.880 --> 27:35.880
Do you have any respect for the actress?

27:35.880 --> 27:36.960
There he goes again.

27:36.960 --> 27:38.350
Do you respect your profession

27:38.350 --> 27:40.310
and this stage?

27:40.790 --> 27:41.680
Sorry, Mr. Tang.

27:41.680 --> 27:42.640
What good is sorry?

27:42.640 --> 27:43.480
Hurry up!

27:50.070 --> 27:50.880
Not good.

27:54.830 --> 27:55.350
This one.

27:55.350 --> 27:56.410
Alright, Mr. Tang.

28:02.110 --> 28:03.640
Pick one you like.

28:20.310 --> 28:21.750
I think this one is nice.

28:21.850 --> 28:22.890
It suits me well.

28:23.480 --> 28:24.160
Okay.

28:25.240 --> 28:26.640
Here, let me help you.

28:31.160 --> 28:31.880
Looks great on me.

28:31.880 --> 28:33.560
When you put on this necklace,

28:34.640 --> 28:36.040
you remind me of someone.

28:36.480 --> 28:37.200
Who?

28:39.880 --> 28:40.640
I'm sorry.

28:42.680 --> 28:43.310
Mr. Tang,

28:43.750 --> 28:44.750
are you okay?

29:07.130 --> 29:08.320
Why doesn't she say anything?

29:08.320 --> 29:09.920
She's a newcomer, after all.

29:10.440 --> 29:11.830
Can she really do this?

29:19.680 --> 29:20.610
What's going on?

29:41.770 --> 29:42.660
Look...

29:44.640 --> 29:46.030
how beautiful I am

29:47.180 --> 29:48.420
in the mirror.

29:49.970 --> 29:51.420
But I know

29:52.880 --> 29:54.160
this isn't the real me.

29:56.510 --> 29:58.880
It's only the me you want to see.

29:59.640 --> 30:01.570
A movie star who is always smiling,

30:02.200 --> 30:03.640
always graceful,

30:05.110 --> 30:07.510
and always perfect.

30:10.430 --> 30:11.920
Sometimes,

30:13.880 --> 30:15.640
I can't even tell...

30:18.110 --> 30:20.440
which one is the real me.

30:23.480 --> 30:25.240
Is it the glamorous me

30:26.750 --> 30:28.510
on the screen,

30:29.960 --> 30:32.310
or the me...

30:35.270 --> 30:36.200
crying secretly

30:36.790 --> 30:38.440
late at night?

30:39.030 --> 30:40.270
You all say

30:40.620 --> 30:43.420
I'm the most beautiful woman
in Republican China.

30:43.510 --> 30:45.030
But who knows

30:47.070 --> 30:48.730
that even a beauty's tears...

30:51.110 --> 30:52.700
are bitter.

30:54.440 --> 30:56.030
You love me for my beauty,

30:57.070 --> 30:58.920
but beauty is fleeting!

30:59.680 --> 31:01.270
You chase after my fame,

31:01.920 --> 31:03.920
but fame is nothing but an illusion.

31:04.740 --> 31:06.550
I've played so many roles,

31:07.070 --> 31:08.830
yet I've never managed to play myself.

31:08.830 --> 31:10.480
I've fooled everyone,

31:11.070 --> 31:12.240
yet

31:12.640 --> 31:14.350
I can never fool my own heart.

31:15.510 --> 31:17.640
The saddest thing in the world is

31:18.790 --> 31:21.240
not even being able to tell for yourself

31:22.600 --> 31:24.430
if you're acting

31:26.240 --> 31:27.750
or living.

31:32.150 --> 31:33.110
Perhaps...

31:37.070 --> 31:38.030
Perhaps...

31:38.830 --> 31:41.200
Perhaps I have long since become

31:41.920 --> 31:44.320
the most successful role I've ever played!

32:08.440 --> 32:09.400
See that?

32:09.400 --> 32:11.610
That's what you call
the most sincere performance!

32:11.610 --> 32:12.480
She's our lead actress.

32:12.480 --> 32:13.740
No objections, right?

32:14.310 --> 32:15.070
Manyu,

32:15.070 --> 32:16.110
let's have dinner tonight

32:16.110 --> 32:16.960
to celebrate!

32:19.510 --> 32:20.030
Manyu?

32:20.590 --> 32:21.240
Manyu.

32:25.110 --> 32:25.790
Manyu?

32:29.000 --> 32:29.750
What's wrong?

32:29.750 --> 32:30.880
Still in character?

32:39.020 --> 32:39.910
Manyu.

32:44.200 --> 32:45.200
Someone,

32:45.200 --> 32:46.160
quick!

32:46.180 --> 32:47.240
The actress has collapsed!

32:47.240 --> 32:48.100
Who told you...

32:48.560 --> 32:50.710
Take all these accessories off her!

33:08.350 --> 33:09.350
Why are you all...

33:10.800 --> 33:12.730
Why are you all crowding around me?

33:13.440 --> 33:15.310
Why am I sitting on the floor, Mr. Tang?

33:15.310 --> 33:15.830
Come on,

33:16.000 --> 33:16.720
help me up.

33:17.680 --> 33:18.680
Just now, I was...

33:18.790 --> 33:20.720
Just now, I was standing here by myself,

33:20.720 --> 33:22.510
and suddenly, my mind went blank.

33:22.510 --> 33:23.040
Then I...

33:23.310 --> 33:24.880
Then I blacked out.

33:25.720 --> 33:26.310
What does she mean?

33:26.310 --> 33:27.440
Oh my God.

33:27.510 --> 33:29.160
Did you hear that?

33:29.200 --> 33:30.830
Did you hear what she said?

33:30.830 --> 33:32.510
That's what you call getting into it.

33:32.510 --> 33:33.720
That's what you call being in character.

33:33.720 --> 33:35.920
That's what you call becoming the role!

33:37.790 --> 33:39.200
Many actors

33:39.200 --> 33:41.730
never reach that state
in their entire lives.

33:41.920 --> 33:42.550
Manyu,

33:44.030 --> 33:47.160
you're the most gifted girl
I've ever seen.

33:47.160 --> 33:48.550
You have to be an actress.

33:48.550 --> 33:50.720
You're the future of cinema itself!

34:28.510 --> 34:29.360
Mr. Tang.

34:30.590 --> 34:31.590
Are you crazy?

34:31.760 --> 34:33.320
There's no overtime pay here.

34:33.320 --> 34:35.000
I know, but didn't we audition
a whole bunch of people?

34:35.000 --> 34:36.730
I think we should keep looking.

34:36.909 --> 34:39.230
What's there to consider?

34:39.590 --> 34:42.000
Isn't Miss Manyu already set
to play the role?

34:42.000 --> 34:43.730
What else is there to consider?

34:43.840 --> 34:46.500
Right, I was just about to
talk to you about that.

34:46.510 --> 34:49.000
I think this new girlfriend of yours

34:49.230 --> 34:50.510
did quite well in the audition.

34:50.510 --> 34:51.230
Right?

34:51.320 --> 34:52.800
But she's a newcomer after all.

34:52.800 --> 34:53.670
Do you know

34:54.070 --> 34:54.880
how many stars

34:54.880 --> 34:56.400
want to be

34:56.400 --> 34:58.190
in this film right now?

34:58.550 --> 34:59.190
I think

34:59.190 --> 35:01.360
it's still too risky to use a newcomer.

35:04.030 --> 35:05.840
I think you have a point.

35:06.230 --> 35:08.630
Using a newcomer really is too risky.

35:08.630 --> 35:10.110
And it just so happens

35:10.110 --> 35:11.800
that many famous directors

35:11.800 --> 35:13.840
have been calling me non-stop these days.

35:13.840 --> 35:16.230
They say they're very sincere

35:16.440 --> 35:18.400
and want to direct this movie.

35:18.800 --> 35:20.800
Do you think I should consider them?

35:21.280 --> 35:22.590
Have I wavered?

35:23.110 --> 35:23.920
Mr. Tang, let...

35:23.920 --> 35:25.350
let me pour you a cup of coffee.

35:25.350 --> 35:26.620
I've quit coffee.

35:27.190 --> 35:28.070
As for you,

35:29.150 --> 35:31.000
I understand that you artistic types
have your pursuits.

35:31.000 --> 35:32.840
That's only natural.

35:33.510 --> 35:35.150
But don't forget

35:36.110 --> 35:37.320
who

35:37.840 --> 35:39.550
art is supposed to serve.

35:41.590 --> 35:43.360
Alright, it's fine.

35:43.360 --> 35:44.840
Since I'm here,

35:45.190 --> 35:47.670
play Miss Manyu's audition footage

35:47.670 --> 35:49.070
from today again.

35:49.920 --> 35:52.230
Put on Reel Six.

36:00.590 --> 36:02.230
Scene 3, Shot 3, Take 3.

36:13.440 --> 36:14.670
No, wait a minute.

36:14.960 --> 36:16.110
Run that again...

36:16.110 --> 36:17.770
Run that again from the start.

36:26.450 --> 36:27.570
Look.

36:27.880 --> 36:29.480
This is what you call talent.

36:31.400 --> 36:32.530
Something's wrong.

36:33.440 --> 36:36.130
Did you forget to
clean the lens before playing it?

36:36.130 --> 36:37.930
Come on, play it again from here.

36:41.670 --> 36:42.510
Mr. Tang, look.

36:42.510 --> 36:43.440
What am I supposed to look at?

36:43.440 --> 36:45.070
How can I see anything
with you standing there?

36:45.070 --> 36:46.360
You're not wearing your glasses,
so you can't see clearly.

36:46.360 --> 36:47.840
Come up here and look.

36:49.230 --> 36:50.060
Right.

36:50.080 --> 36:50.920
Right, here.

36:51.350 --> 36:52.230
What's wrong?

36:52.790 --> 36:53.500
Look.

37:21.630 --> 37:22.960
You mean

37:23.330 --> 37:25.210
He Manzhi is back?

37:25.400 --> 37:27.110
She never left.

37:28.480 --> 37:30.030
Well, she has to go!

37:30.050 --> 37:32.180
Didn't you perform a ritual last time?

37:32.210 --> 37:34.920
I'd persuaded Ms. He
to let go of her resentment

37:35.030 --> 37:36.800
and move on to her next life soon.

37:36.800 --> 37:38.550
And she'd agreed.

37:39.110 --> 37:41.110
But have you been talking about her again?

37:41.110 --> 37:43.000
If you don't let go of your attachment,

37:43.000 --> 37:44.550
how can she let go?

37:45.230 --> 37:46.770
I didn't really talk about her much.

37:46.770 --> 37:48.760
Do you really think
I don't read the newspaper?

37:48.760 --> 37:49.840
The whole country knows

37:49.840 --> 37:51.100
you're making a movie.

37:51.190 --> 37:52.920
Wouldn't the underworld know?

37:53.630 --> 37:55.280
After Ms. He's soul

37:55.280 --> 37:56.400
became a vengeful ghost,

37:56.400 --> 37:57.840
she had to attach herself

37:57.920 --> 37:59.150
to something she'd used in life

37:59.150 --> 38:01.210
in order to remain in the human world.

38:02.510 --> 38:05.030
Have you touched
any of her belongings lately?

38:05.030 --> 38:06.280
Think carefully.

38:06.710 --> 38:09.150
Something she wore often
when she was alive.

38:09.150 --> 38:10.190
I think this one is quite nice.

38:10.190 --> 38:11.440
There's a lot of her aura on it.

38:11.440 --> 38:13.630
Take all these accessories off her!

38:16.240 --> 38:17.160
The necklace.

38:17.670 --> 38:19.590
I shouldn't have touched that necklace.

38:19.590 --> 38:21.790
It was the one Manzhi loved to wear most.

38:21.880 --> 38:24.150
You must give me the necklace
as soon as possible

38:24.150 --> 38:25.800
so I can perform a ritual
to suppress her spirit.

38:25.800 --> 38:26.550
Otherwise,

38:26.670 --> 38:27.880
Miss Manyu is

38:28.510 --> 38:30.800
very likely to be possessed by He Manzhi.

38:31.400 --> 38:32.590
You mean,

38:33.190 --> 38:35.250
as long as Manyu wears that necklace,

38:35.400 --> 38:36.670
she'll be...

38:37.960 --> 38:38.800
possessed?

38:40.440 --> 38:42.170
Once the possession succeeds,

38:42.360 --> 38:44.150
Miss Manyu's three souls and seven spirits

38:44.150 --> 38:45.230
will be scattered,

38:45.250 --> 38:47.040
and she can never be saved.

38:47.710 --> 38:48.550
Remember,

38:48.880 --> 38:50.360
never let Miss Manyu

38:50.510 --> 38:51.550
touch that necklace again.

38:51.550 --> 38:52.710
But I did it with her.

38:52.710 --> 38:54.110
Am I in danger?

38:54.330 --> 38:55.390
You did what with her?

38:55.390 --> 38:55.840
I...

38:57.880 --> 38:58.510
just...

38:58.630 --> 39:01.360
Just some simple physical contact.

39:02.280 --> 39:03.630
You're in danger now.

39:03.800 --> 39:04.510
Remember,

39:05.400 --> 39:07.030
do not go near Miss Manyu again.

39:07.030 --> 39:08.360
Or you'll be tainted by the resentment

39:08.360 --> 39:10.000
and end up torn to pieces!

39:12.590 --> 39:13.710
But...

39:13.760 --> 39:15.280
You saw it that day too.

39:15.480 --> 39:17.880
With all those reporters there,
I already put it out there.

39:17.880 --> 39:21.590
I have to see Manyu again.

39:23.000 --> 39:25.070
Do you really have to make this movie?

39:25.360 --> 39:26.630
I have to.

39:27.400 --> 39:29.190
This is my last chance.

39:30.190 --> 39:31.190
That necklace...

39:33.630 --> 39:34.510
Possession.

39:39.190 --> 39:39.840
Master.

39:41.800 --> 39:43.150
I have an idea.

39:50.110 --> 39:51.360
Miss Jiang,

39:51.550 --> 39:53.030
what's that in your hand?

39:55.440 --> 39:56.190
A script.

39:56.760 --> 39:58.190
Tang Yushan's ending.

39:58.800 --> 39:59.960
You guessed right.

40:00.150 --> 40:01.670
This isn't over yet.

40:02.510 --> 40:04.280
Tang Yushan will come
looking for me again.

40:04.280 --> 40:06.230
The first time I met that man,

40:06.480 --> 40:08.480
I knew exactly what kind of person he was.

40:08.480 --> 40:09.760
Incredibly greedy.

40:10.030 --> 40:11.590
After He Manzhi died,

40:11.880 --> 40:13.400
he got himself into even more debt.

40:13.400 --> 40:14.760
So he definitely won't

40:15.070 --> 40:17.270
let this opportunity slip by this time.

40:17.800 --> 40:18.510
Master,

40:18.710 --> 40:19.960
this is a donation

40:19.960 --> 40:21.430
I've prepared for your Yunhe Temple.

40:21.430 --> 40:23.240
Please accept it.

40:24.320 --> 40:26.550
Of course, I also have
a presumptuous request.

40:26.550 --> 40:27.710
To be exact,

40:28.000 --> 40:29.920
only you can help me with it.

40:30.150 --> 40:32.110
I want everyone to witness

40:32.110 --> 40:33.880
He Manzhi's return.

40:34.110 --> 40:36.030
You want me to summon her soul?

40:36.400 --> 40:37.390
It shouldn't be hard, right?

40:37.390 --> 40:40.280
Tang Yushan will come to you again
to summon her soul,

40:40.280 --> 40:42.230
because he's seen you perform
that paper effigy ritual

40:42.230 --> 40:44.950
and knows you have the real skills
to protect him.

40:44.950 --> 40:45.800
So?

40:45.820 --> 40:47.900
So play it cool

40:48.180 --> 40:49.040
and ignore him.

40:49.040 --> 40:50.040
Movies

40:50.060 --> 40:52.540
sell spectacle and dreams.

40:52.570 --> 40:53.220
Alright.

40:53.790 --> 40:55.910
Let's hold a press conference

40:56.190 --> 40:58.510
and announce a film

40:58.510 --> 40:59.760
starring a ghost.

40:59.880 --> 41:01.000
Won't the public be curious?

41:01.000 --> 41:01.960
Won't they be surprised?

41:01.960 --> 41:03.670
Won't it sell tickets?

41:04.400 --> 41:05.480
This movie is bound to be a hit.

41:05.480 --> 41:07.070
That's a brilliant idea.

41:07.320 --> 41:08.920
It really is a selling point.

41:09.030 --> 41:10.360
Even Hollywood

41:10.360 --> 41:12.280
hasn't come up with a stunt

41:12.280 --> 41:13.480
like using a ghost in a movie.

41:13.480 --> 41:14.190
Master,

41:14.320 --> 41:15.510
you heard him, right?

41:15.510 --> 41:17.240
Not even Hollywood has done it.

41:17.280 --> 41:18.510
The future of cinema

41:18.510 --> 41:19.840
is counting on you.

41:20.280 --> 41:21.630
I...

41:23.920 --> 41:25.000
can't do this.

41:25.920 --> 41:26.880
Even if he begs,

41:26.970 --> 41:28.330
you can't agree immediately.

41:28.330 --> 41:29.040
Of course,

41:29.480 --> 41:31.030
money can't sway me.

41:31.290 --> 41:32.890
But enough money

41:33.630 --> 41:35.320
can.

41:36.260 --> 41:37.960
Body possession is no small matter.

41:37.960 --> 41:40.460
Miss Manyu has been
possessed several times.

41:40.460 --> 41:42.280
She could drop dead at any moment.

41:42.280 --> 41:43.630
As a Taoist,

41:43.630 --> 41:46.630
if I let some innocent girl
lose her life for no reason,

41:47.320 --> 41:48.920
it'd damage my cultivation.

41:49.190 --> 41:50.630
We can compensate for

41:50.760 --> 41:52.000
all the harm done to everyone.

41:52.000 --> 41:54.590
If she dies, how can the film be made?

41:55.000 --> 41:56.670
Wouldn't the whole project fall apart?

41:56.670 --> 41:57.630
I think

41:57.760 --> 41:59.840
we should discuss it carefully.

42:00.110 --> 42:01.280
You can't

42:01.440 --> 42:04.170
go to any lengths
just to make money, right, Tang?

42:04.320 --> 42:05.280
Nonsense!

42:05.550 --> 42:07.360
Who said I'm doing this
for freaking money?

42:07.360 --> 42:08.650
Have I ever cared about money?

42:08.650 --> 42:10.050
Even if you refuse him,

42:10.170 --> 42:11.900
he definitely won't let you go.

42:12.190 --> 42:13.800
Because Tang Yushan is determined

42:13.800 --> 42:15.880
to make a fortune off the dead this time.

42:15.880 --> 42:16.710
Of course.

42:16.960 --> 42:19.590
He'll definitely use love as an excuse,

42:19.800 --> 42:21.760
telling you everything he does

42:22.110 --> 42:23.320
is for love.

42:23.320 --> 42:25.150
Master, now I'm asking you

42:25.400 --> 42:27.030
to reunite my wife and me

42:27.030 --> 42:28.670
in another way.

42:28.800 --> 42:31.000
Wouldn't that be a good deed on your part?

42:31.000 --> 42:32.590
It's not entirely impossible.

42:32.590 --> 42:33.360
However,

42:33.510 --> 42:35.320
the ritual isn't that simple.

42:36.110 --> 42:37.440
It'll have to be double.

42:38.190 --> 42:39.030
Understood.

42:39.360 --> 42:40.480
Double the effort.

42:41.670 --> 42:43.030
I have something else to take care of.

42:43.030 --> 42:43.800
I'll take my leave.

42:43.800 --> 42:45.510
Hearing that the investment
needs to be doubled,

42:45.510 --> 42:47.150
some investors will surely pull out.

42:47.150 --> 42:48.380
What if he wants to pull out too?

42:48.380 --> 42:48.970
See you.

42:49.000 --> 42:49.930
What then?

42:49.950 --> 42:51.380
Talk to him about gambling.

42:51.380 --> 42:53.510
That's the only thing
he truly understands.

42:53.510 --> 42:55.910
Actually, playing cards is just like life.

42:56.000 --> 42:58.860
Most of the time,
you're just drawing from the deck.

42:59.000 --> 43:00.800
Whether you win or lose in the end

43:00.840 --> 43:02.670
comes down to those one or two big hands.

43:02.670 --> 43:03.360
Master,

43:03.590 --> 43:04.480
then please

43:04.760 --> 43:06.890
help us read the fortune of this movie.

43:07.070 --> 43:08.360
Now Tang Yushan

43:08.360 --> 43:10.880
is facing
the most important card game of his life.

43:10.880 --> 43:14.110
He needs someone by his side
to make him go all in.

43:14.360 --> 43:15.550
Spring thunder has rolled in.

43:15.550 --> 43:16.760
After the three signs of Jingzhe,

43:16.760 --> 43:18.960
new shoots will break through the soil.

43:19.070 --> 43:20.200
What does that mean?

43:22.000 --> 43:23.760
Do you play cards often?

43:24.360 --> 43:25.710
You've played

43:25.710 --> 43:27.840
your share of card games, big and small.

43:27.840 --> 43:28.920
This time,

43:29.550 --> 43:30.710
what you're holding

43:31.230 --> 43:32.800
is a strong hand.

43:35.880 --> 43:37.050
You're absolutely right.

43:37.050 --> 43:38.370
I've had my share of wins and losses,

43:38.370 --> 43:41.630
but I've always felt like
I was just one hand away from the big win.

43:41.630 --> 43:42.960
I can feel it.

43:43.280 --> 43:44.670
This time, I've drawn the big hand

43:44.670 --> 43:47.070
that can change my fate.

43:47.280 --> 43:48.840
No one can talk me out of it.

43:49.000 --> 43:50.510
Even if I have to borrow from loan sharks,

43:50.510 --> 43:52.320
I'm making this movie!

43:53.800 --> 43:54.920
I'm going all in.

43:58.100 --> 44:00.330
[In the next episode]

44:00.400 --> 44:01.150
Where there's a female ghost,

44:01.150 --> 44:02.840
there has to be a Taoist sorcerer.

44:02.840 --> 44:04.690
But has anyone ever thought about

44:04.690 --> 44:06.030
the possibility that this sorcerer

44:06.030 --> 44:08.030
is in cahoots with the female ghost?

44:09.110 --> 44:10.630
Everyone, out.

44:10.800 --> 44:12.880
I need to help her quickly understand

44:13.070 --> 44:15.050
what the character was feeling
at the time.

44:15.050 --> 44:16.380
Let me tell you a secret.

44:16.410 --> 44:17.850
Have you ever thought

44:18.080 --> 44:19.920
that He Manzhi
might not have killed herself?

44:19.920 --> 44:20.880
Let go of me.

44:20.900 --> 44:21.940
Smile.

44:22.320 --> 44:24.680
Smile, and I'll let you
walk out of that door alive.
